{"speciesId":68,"names":{"fr":"Mackogneur","es":"Machamp","en":"Machamp","ja":"カイリキー"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"Using its heavy muscles, it throws powerful punches that can send the victim clear over the horizon."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"Using its heavy muscles, it throws powerful punches that can send the victim clear over the horizon."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"One arm alone can move mountains. Using all four arms, this POKéMON fires off awesome punches."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"It quickly swings its four arms to rock its opponents with ceaseless punches and chops from all angles."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"It uses its four powerful arms to pin the limbs of its foe, then throws the victim over the horizon."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"With four arms that react more quickly than it can think, it can execute many punches at once."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"MACHAMP has the power to hurl anything aside. However, trying to do any work requiring care and dexterity causes its arms to get tangled. This POKéMON tends to leap into action before it thinks."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"MACHAMP is known as the POKéMON that has mastered every kind of martial arts. If it grabs hold of the foe with its four arms, the battle is all but over. The hapless foe is thrown far over the horizon."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It is impossible to defend against punches and chops doled out by its four arms. Its fighting spirit flares up when it faces a tough opponent."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"Its four ruggedly developed arms can launch a flurry of 1,000 punches in just two seconds."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"Its superpowerful punches are said to knock the victim flying clear over the horizon."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It punches with its four arms at blinding speed. It can launch 1,000 punches in two seconds."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It can knock a train flying with a punch. However, it is terrible at delicate work using its fingers."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Its four muscled arms slam foes with powerful punches and chops at blinding speed."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It quickly swings its four arms to rock its opponents with ceaseless punches and chops from all angles."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It uses its four powerful arms to pin the limbs of its foe, then throws the victim over the horizon."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"La puissance et la rapidité de ses quatre bras puissants font des ravages sur ses adversaires."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Its four muscled arms slam foes with powerful punches and chops at blinding speed."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"La puissance et la rapidité de ses quatre bras puissants font des ravages sur ses adversaires."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Its four muscled arms slam foes with powerful punches and chops at blinding speed."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Its four muscled arms slam foes with powerful punches and chops at blinding speed."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Its four muscled arms slam foes with powerful punches and chops at blinding speed."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Ses deux paires de bras permettent à Mackogneur d’envoyer une série de 1 000 coups de poing en 2 s."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Tiene cuatro brazos tan bien desarrollados que puede dar una serie de 1000 puñetazos en cuestión de dos segundos."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Its four ruggedly developed arms can launch a flurry of 1,000 punches in just two seconds."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"発達した ４本の 腕は ２秒間に １０００発の パンチを 繰り出すことができる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il se sert de ses quatre bras pour enserrer les membres de sa victime puis il la projette au loin."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Usa sus cuatro poderosos brazos para agarrar a su enemigo y lanzarlo lo más lejos posible."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It uses its four powerful arms to pin the limbs of its foe, then throws the victim over the horizon."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"４本の 腕で 相手の 手足を 押さえこみ 自由を 奪うと 地平線の 向こうまで 投げ飛ばす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Mackogneur est capable de déplacer n’importe quelle masse. Cependant, ses bras s’emmêlent dès qu’il essaie de réaliser un travail délicat ou minutieux. Ce Pokémon a tendance à cogner d’abord et à réfléchir ensuite."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Machamp es tan fuerte que puede derribar lo que quiera. Sin embargo, cuando tiene que realizar una tarea que requiere delicadeza y destreza, se le enredan los brazos. Este Pokémon pasa a la acción sin pensar."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Machamp has the power to hurl anything aside. However, trying to do any work requiring care and dexterity causes its arms to get tangled. This Pokémon tends to leap into action before it thinks."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"なんでも 投げ飛ばす パワーを 持つが 細かい 作業を すると 腕が 絡まってしまう。 考える よりも 先に 体が 動く。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Mackogneur est célèbre, car c’est le seul Pokémon qui a réussi à maîtriser tous les types d’arts martiaux. S’il parvient à attraper son ennemi avec ses quatre bras, il le projette par-delà l’horizon."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Machamp es conocido como el Pokémon que domina todas las artes marciales. Si agarra a su rival con los cuatro brazos que tiene, su enemigo no tendrá nada que hacer. El pobre contrincante saldrá volando hasta perderse en el horizonte."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Machamp is known as the Pokémon that has mastered every kind of martial arts. If it grabs hold of the foe with its four arms, the battle is all but over. The hapless foe is thrown far over the horizon."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"あらゆる 格闘技を マスターした ポケモン。 ４本の 腕で つかまれたら もう 終り。 地平線の 向こうまで 投げ飛ばされてしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il est capable de donner des coups de poing d’une puissance d’une mégatonne, qui envoient ses adversaires voler jusqu’à l’horizon."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Puede hacer que sus rivales se pierdan en el horizonte con puñetazos que llegan a alcanzar hasta un megatón de potencia."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It unleashes megaton-level punches that send opponents flying clear over the horizon."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"メガトン級の パンチを 放ち 立ちふさがる 敵を 地平線の 彼方まで ぶっ飛ばすのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Il soulève sans effort les plus gros camions à benne. Mais il n’est pas habile de ses mains, et est incapable de faire un travail de précision."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Puede levantar camiones pesados con gran facilidad, pero cuando tiene que hacer algún trabajo más delicado, fracasa estrepitosamente."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"It can lift heavy loads with the greatest of ease. It can even heft dump trucks. But its clumsy fingers prevent it from doing any precision work."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"ダンプさえ 軽々 持ち上げる。 ただし 指先は 不器用で 細かい 仕事は まるで 無理。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il attrape son adversaire avec ses quatre mains avant de le tordre de différentes façons. On appelle cela le Massage Spécial Mackogneur."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Agarra a su rival con sus cuatro manos y lo inmoviliza con una llave imposible que se conoce como la Especial de Machamp."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It grasps its opponents with its four arms and twists them up in an intricate hold. People call it “the Machamp special.”"},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"４本の 腕で 相手を 捕らえ 複雑な 形に 締め上げる。 カイリキースペシャルと 人は呼ぶ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Ses quatre bras lui permettent d’attaquer et de se défendre en même temps. Il maîtriserait tous les arts martiaux existants."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Sus cuatro brazos le permiten atacar y defender simultáneamente. Se dice que domina todas las artes marciales habidas y por haber."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"With four arms, it can attack and defend simultaneously. It’s said to have mastered every martial art in the world."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"４本の 腕で 攻めも 守りも 同時に こなす。 この世の すべての 格闘技を 極めている という。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Il peut bouger une montagne d’un bras, alors rien ne lui résiste quand il utilise les quatre en même temps."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Un brazo le basta para mover montañas y, si usa los cuatro, asesta puñetazos de una potencia descomunal."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"One arm alone can move mountains. Using all four arms, this Pokémon fires off awesome punches."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"１本でも 山を 動かせる 力をもった 腕を ４本すべて 使って 凄いパンチを くり出す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Il peut bouger une montagne d’un bras, alors rien ne lui résiste quand il utilise les quatre en même temps."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Un brazo le basta para mover montañas y, si usa los cuatro, asesta puñetazos de una potencia descomunal."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"One arm alone can move mountains. Using all four arms, this Pokémon fires off awesome punches."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"１本でも 山を 動かせる 力をもった 腕を ４本すべて 使って 凄いパンチを くり出す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il peut bouger ses quatre bras à grande vitesse et frapper du poing ou du tranchant de la main dans toutes les directions sans se fatiguer."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Mueve rápidamente sus cuatro brazos para asestar incesantes golpes y puñetazos desde todos los ángulos."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It quickly swings its four arms to rock its opponents with ceaseless punches and chops from all angles."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"４本の腕を すばやく 動かし あらゆる 角度から 休むことなく パンチや チョップを 叩きこむ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il enchaîne les coups de poing avec ses quatre bras à une vitesse surprenante."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Puede dar varios puñetazos de una sola vez gracias a sus cuatro brazos. Golpea más rápido de lo que piensa."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"With four arms that react more quickly than it can think, it can execute many punches at once."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"４本の 腕は 考えるより 早く 反射的に 動き 何発もの パンチを 繰りだせる。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"In close combat, its four arms afford it offensive and defensive supremacy. In but a blink, this valiant Pokémon can overwhelm its foes with more than 1,000 blows from its fists."}],"varieties":[{"id":68,"moves":[{"name":"karate-chop","learns":[[1,"level-up",1],[2,"level-up",1],[3,"level-up",15],[4,"level-up",15],[5,"level-up",13],[6,"level-up",13],[7,"level-up",13],[8,"level-up",10],[9,"level-up",10],[10,"level-up",10],[11,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",10],[12,"level-up",13],[13,"level-up",13],[14,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",10],[15,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",10],[16,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",7],[17,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",7],[18,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",7],[19,"level-up",16],[28,"level-up",1],[29,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[1,"machine",0],[2,"machine",0],[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[28,"machine",0],[29,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor"